    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Uika Misumi, the charismatic guitarist-vocalist of Ave Mujica, as well as a member of the idol unit sumimi. Her hobbies include stargazing. Concern for Sakiko also appears to be a forefront preoccupation of hers."
